# privacy - dynamic box preset (dynamic-box-arch, pure config-to-kernel)
#
# Self-contained multi-section blob for:  sbie-rt create privacy.kv
# The driver embeds NO defaults - the two skeleton sections below are
# the box's own copy (extracted from SandboxieOSS/Templates.ini);
# [BoxConfig] becomes the generated BoxConfig_<id> section.
#
# privacy (PMod-equivalent) box: shadow-write the registry user hive
# and all drive roots (WriteKeyPath/WriteFilePath), read-through
# whitelist for system locations, pre-created default folders.
# UseRuleSpecificity=y is required so the Normal*Path whitelist rules
# can override the broad Write*Path shadow rules; on equal patterns the
# write list still wins (matched before the normal list).
# Keys inline the old [TemplatePModPaths] + [TemplateDefaultFolders].

